26:T52c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Madinah from Taif by road?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 480 km, roughly 4.5 hours of driving before stops. With prayer and rest breaks, plan on most of the day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we stop for prayer and rest on the way?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell the driver whenever you want to stop for prayer, food or rest. Say how many breaks you expect when you book so the timing is planned."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I be picked up at Madinah Airport and driven to Taif?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Send your flight number; we track the flight and meet you at arrivals, with 15–30 minutes of free waiting included."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we stop in Makkah on the way to Taif?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Ask for a multi-stop trip and we quote it as one journey. Non-Muslim passengers are routed around Makkah."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a private car from Madinah to Taif?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fare is fixed and agreed on WhatsApp before you book. It depends on the vehicle, date and any stops; send your details and we usually reply within 1–2 hours."}}]}1b:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] pb-28 text-[#1C1C1C] lg:pb-16","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Madinah to Taif private transfer\",\"description\":\"Madinah to Taif is about 480 km by road, roughly 4.5 hours of driving before stops, and in practice most of a day with rest and prayer breaks. Taxi Saudi Arabia arranges a private car with driver from your Madinah hotel or Prince Mohammad bin Abdulaziz Airport (MED) to any Taif address, with one fixed fare agreed on WhatsApp before booking.\",\"serviceType\":