35:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"sr-tradeoff","className":"rounded-3xl border border-[#16A34A]/15 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"sr-tradeoff","className":"font-heading flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-bold","children":[["$","$L2e",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M12 3v18","key":"108xh3"}],["path",{"d":"m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7","key":"zcdpyk"}],["path",{"d":"M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1","key":"1yorad"}],["path",{"d":"m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7","key":"eua70x"}],["path",{"d":"M7 21h10","key":"1b0cd5"}]],"className":"lucide-scale h-5 w-5 text-[#16A34A]","aria-hidden":true}]," ","Private car or fly from Madinah to Taif?"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","style":{"maxWidth":"70ch"},"children":[["$","p","Flying is quicker in the air, but direct flights between the two cities are limited, and you add check-in, baggage and transfers at both ends. For a family with luggage, a private car is often simpler: one pickup at the hotel door and one drop-off in Taif.",{"children":"Flying is quicker in the air, but direct flights between the two cities are limited, and you add check-in, baggage and transfers at both ends. For a family with luggage, a private car is often simpler: one pickup at the hotel door and one drop-off in Taif."}],["$","p","The trade-off is time on the road. If you are travelling alone and light, a flight may suit you better; if you are a family or group, or want to stop on the way, the car usually wins.",{"children":"The trade-off is time on the road. If you are travelling alone and light, a flight may suit you better; if you are a family or group, or want to stop on the way, the car usually wins."}],["$","p","Some travellers split the trip — Madinah to Makkah for Umrah, then on to Taif later. Tell us the plan and we quote each leg.",{"children":"Some travellers split the trip — Madinah to Makkah for Umrah, then on to Taif later. Tell us the plan and we quote each leg."}]]}]]}]
